---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import teamData from '../data/team.json';
import { PencilLine, BookOpen, GraduationCap, Users } from '@lucide/astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import patternImg from '../assets/images/pattern.png';
import intro1Img from '../assets/images/intro-1.png';
import intro2Img from '../assets/images/intro-2.png';

// Dynamically resolve local team images
const images = import.meta.glob<{ default: ImageMetadata }>('/src/assets/images/*.{webp,png,jpg,jpeg}');
---
<Layout title="Bab al-Ridha Publications - Home" isHome={true}>
  <Hero />

  {/* Introduction Section */}
  <section class="py-24 bg-[#fcfbf7] relative overflow-hidden">
    {/* Subtle Background Pattern */}
    <div 
      class="absolute right-0 top-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none" 
      style={{ backgroundImage: `url(${patternImg.src})`, backgroundSize: '600px', backgroundPosition: 'center' }}
    ></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-900">Introduction</h2>
        <div class="h-0.5 w-16 bg-emerald-800 mx-auto mt-4"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-20">
        {/* Row 1 */}
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
          {/* Text Left */}
          <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 font-light leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg">
            <p>
              The importance and need of research in different Islamic subjects to present the correct and precise view of Islam, and to defend Islam from various doubts that are raised, especially from Western academic circles, is undeniable. Therefore, one of the important duties and skills that is necessary for students of Hawza is the duty of doing research in different Islamic subjects and producing novel research that will be of benefit to the progress of Islam.
            </p>
            <p>
              In addition, any successful academic activity requires strong planning and curriculum to make it successful and effective. Therefore, given the fact that Intensive Short Course (BRISC) and Online Learning Platform (OLP) focus on providing academic activities and services, they require well-researched and accurate course titles, course materials, authentic books, etc. to ensure the quality and accuracy of the content being offered.
            </p>
          </div>
          {/* Image Right */}
          <div class="relative group">
            <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-emerald-950/5 blur-[80px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-white transform hover:scale-[1.03] hover:-rotate-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out">
              <Image 
                src={intro2Img} 
                alt="Scholarly Academic Library" 
                class="w-full h-80 object-cover transform transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Row 2 */}
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
          {/* Image Left */}
          <div class="relative group md:order-1 order-2">
            <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-emerald-950/5 blur-[80px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-white transform hover:scale-[1.03] hover:rotate-1 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out">
              <Image 
                src={intro1Img} 
                alt="Classical Islamic Manuscripts and Books" 
                class="w-full h-80 object-cover transform transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-105"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          {/* Text Right */}
          <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-700 font-light leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg md:order-2 order-1">
            <p>
              Although a good number of Islamic books have been translated into English, mainly from Persian and Arabic. However, the Islamic resources available in English face these shortcomings and challenges: many books are translated without keeping in mind the needs and requirements of English-speaking readers, the quality of translation is not up to the mark, the books are printed in a non-standard formatting, many of the good books are not easily available and accessible owing to a poor marketing system.
            </p>
            <p>
              In addition to this, little attention is paid to authoring Islamic books with strong and authentic content based on the different needs of English-speaking readers and publishing them in attractive formats, and marketing them so that they are easily accessible. As a result, despite people’s interest in Islam and the Islamic way of life, a sufficient number of solid books are not available in many areas and subjects.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Aims & Objectives Section */}
  <section class="py-32 relative bg-emerald-950 overflow-hidden">
    {/* Full Section Pattern Overlay */}
    <div 
      class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] pointer-events-none mix-blend-overlay" 
      style={{ backgroundImage: `url(${patternImg.src})`, backgroundSize: '250px' }}
    ></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-24 space-y-6">
        <p class="text-emerald-400 font-black tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-[10px]">The Roadmap</p>
        <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif text-white">Aims &amp; Objectives</h2>
        <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-emerald-500 mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-emerald-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <PencilLine class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-wide">Original Research Support</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-100/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">To encourage and support original research work in English. To identify and collaborate with capable Hawza students for producing research work on selected topics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-emerald-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <BookOpen class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-wide">High-Quality Publishing</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-100/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">To author and publish high quality Islamic material on relevant and important topics in English in suitable formats.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-emerald-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <GraduationCap class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-wide">Curriculum & Study Material</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-100/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">Author teaching manuals and other study material for courses conducted across other departments of the institute.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-emerald-400 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
              <Users class="w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-white mb-4 tracking-wide">Academic Training & Workshops</h3>
            <p class="text-emerald-100/80 font-light leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">Conduct seminars, workshops, classes to train Hawza students in the skills of research, English writing and book authoring, translation, teaching; and other such research and publication related skills.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Team Section */}
  <!-- <section class="py-32 bg-[#fcfbf7] relative">
     <div 
      class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 w-full h-64 opacity-[0.02] pointer-events-none" 
